# Redesign Official Identification Section — Stakeholder Registration

## Background

The current Official Identification section (`uploaded_documents_u_r`) uses the API-provided `child_fields` (Document Type, ID Number, Expiry Date, and a single Attach field). The user wants a redesigned layout with **Document Name**, **Document Type** (auto-set to `Identity`), and two separate file upload fields (**Front** and **Back**) with per-document mandatory rules.

## Proposed Changes

All changes are scoped to **Stakeholder Registration only**. No other form is affected.

---

### 1. Replace child_fields for uploaded_documents_u_r

#### [MODIFY] [UniversalRegistrationForm.tsx](file:///home/iitg_oc_2025/OC_2025/PRORND_UI/prornd-ui-mythos_fable_v0.7/src/pages/application/UniversalRegistrationForm.tsx)

**In the field processing section (around lines 284-296)**, after setting `f.label = "Official Identification (Aadhaar & PAN / Foreigner ID)"`, **replace `f.child_fields`** with custom fields:

```js
f.child_fields = [
  { fieldname: "document_type", label: "Document Name", fieldtype: "Data", mandatory: 1, read_only: 0 },
  { fieldname: "document_category", label: "Document Type", fieldtype: "Data", mandatory: 1, read_only: 1 },
  { fieldname: "document_front", label: "Front", fieldtype: "Attach", mandatory: 1 },
  { fieldname: "document_back", label: "Back", fieldtype: "Attach", mandatory: 0 },
];
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **`document_type` fieldname** is reused for "Document Name" because the backend already saves this field. The user-facing label changes to "Document Name" but the fieldname stays `document_type` for API compatibility. A new field `document_category` is added for the display-only "Identity" value.

